        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p style="text-align: justify;font-weight: 500;">Ronak Optik India Private Limited is a  eyewear business with over a quarter-century of experience in the industry. Established in 1993 with a commitment to quality and customer satisfaction, we’ve grown to become one of India’s largest eyewear  distributors, and offer a vast collection of in-house brands such as IDEE, IRUS and IMAGE eyewear, as well as international brands.
        </p><p style="text-align: justify;font-weight: 500;"> Ronak Optik, we believe in serving everyone, from the   more discerning buyer to the luxury customer.  With Ronak Optik, you’ll find a varied stock of frames ranging from quality in-house to international brands. Our extensive collection is curated to meet diverse tastes and preferences, , guaranteeing that every customer finds their perfect fit.  . Ronak Optik is committed to providing eyewear that combines quality, comfort and style, all within flexible price ranges.</p>
